<div class="stone-powers-dialog">
  <div class="dialog-header">
    <h2>{{actor.name}}: Stone Powers</h2>
    <p class="dialog-header-hint">Oben: <strong>jede Zeile ist ein Attribut‑Pool</strong> (Vitality zeigt immer Vitality‑Steine, Resolve immer Resolve — das ändert sich nicht am Dropdown). Bei General Powers wählt das Dropdown nur, <strong>welcher Pool bezahlt</strong>. Ziehe passende Steine auf ein <strong>aktives</strong> Ablagefeld (gelb); Zahl = Kosten. Kosten &gt; 1: mehrmals denselben Stein‑Typ auf dasselbe Feld ziehen.</p>
  </div>

  {{#unless combatActive}}
  <div class="stone-combat-hint-banner is-info" role="status">
    <i class="fas fa-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span>Kein aktiver Kampf: Du kannst <strong>Steine ziehen</strong> und Standard speichern. Eine Macht <strong>wirkt erst</strong>, wenn ein Kampf läuft und die Figur im <strong>Initiative‑Tracker</strong> steht.</span>
  </div>
  {{else}}
  {{#if combatMissingFromTracker}}
  <div class="stone-combat-hint-banner is-warn" role="alert">
    <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span>Kampf läuft, aber diese Figur wurde im Tracker nicht gefunden (verknüpfter Token / falsches Blatt?). Steine ziehen und Aktivieren sind deaktiviert — Token in die Initiative ziehen oder vom Tracker öffnen.</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  {{/unless}}

  {{#if stonePlanLocked}}
  <div class="stone-plan-locked-banner" role="status">
    <i class="fas fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <div class="stone-plan-locked-text">
      <strong>{{combatLabel}}</strong>
      <span>Steinzuordnung und Aktivieren sind für diese Runde gesperrt, sobald du Bewegung, einen Angriff oder eine Reaktion genutzt hast.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  <div class="stone-pools-display">
    <h3>Available Stones</h3>
    <div class="pools-grid">
      {{#each pools as |pool|}}
      <div class="pool-item" data-attribute="{{pool.key}}">
        <div class="pool-item-header">
          <span class="pool-name">{{pool.name}}</span>
          <span class="pool-value">{{pool.available}}/{{pool.max}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pool-gems" title="{{pool.name}}: {{pool.available}} — Steine zum Ziehen">
          {{#each pool.gemSlots}}
          <span
            class="ms-stone-gem-chip js-stone-draggable{{#unless @root.dragStonesEnabled}} is-drag-disabled{{/unless}}"
            {{#if @root.dragStonesEnabled}}draggable="true"{{else}}draggable="false"{{/if}}
            data-attribute-key="{{../pool.key}}"
            style="background: {{../gemStyle.fill}}; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px {{../gemStyle.stroke}} inset, 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);"
            title="{{../pool.name}}: hier greifen und auf Ablagefeld ziehen"></span>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
        {{#if pool.sustained}}
        <span class="pool-sustained">({{pool.sustained}} sustained)</span>
        {{/if}}
      </div>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="powers-list">
    {{#if generalPowers.length}}
    <details class="power-group is-general" open>
      <summary class="power-group-header">
        <h4>
          <i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i>
          General Powers
        </h4>
        <span class="power-count">({{generalPowers.length}})</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="powers-grid">
        {{#each generalPowers as |power|}}
        <div class="power-row">
          <div class="power-row-main">
            <div class="power-title">
              <strong class="power-name" title="{{power.description}}">{{power.name}}</strong>
              <div class="general-controls">
                <select class="js-general-attr-select" data-power-id="{{power.id}}"
                        {{#if @root.stonePlanLocked}}disabled title="Gesperrt"{{/if}}>
                  {{#each @root.spendableAttributes as |attr|}}
                  <option value="{{attr.key}}" {{#if (eq attr.key power.selectedAttrKey)}}selected{{/if}}
                    data-stone-fill="{{attr.gemStyle.fill}}" data-stone-stroke="{{attr.gemStyle.stroke}}">
                    {{attr.label}}
                  </option>
                  {{/each}}
                </select>
                <button type="button"
                        class="power-activate-btn js-activate-power"
                        data-power-id="{{power.id}}"
                        data-attribute-key="{{power.selectedAttrKey}}"
                        title="Ohne Ziehen aktivieren ({{power.nextCost}})"
                        {{#unless @root.hasCombat}}disabled{{/unless}}
                        {{#if @root.stonePlanLocked}}disabled title="Gesperrt"{{/if}}
                        {{#unless power.canAfford}}disabled title="Zu wenig Steine"{{/unless}}>
                  <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> {{power.nextCost}}
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="power-drop-slots-row">
              <span class="drop-slots-label">Ablage</span>
              <div class="power-drop-slots" data-power-id="{{power.id}}">
                {{#each power.dropSlots as |slot|}}
                <div class="ms-stone-drop-slot slot-{{slot.state}}{{#unless @root.dragStonesEnabled}} slot-no-drag{{/unless}}"
                     data-power-id="{{../power.id}}"
                     data-pay-attribute="{{../power.selectedAttrKey}}"
                     data-slot-index="{{slot.index}}"
                     title="{{#if (eq slot.state 'active')}}Aktiv: {{../power.nextCost}}× passenden Stein ablegen{{/if}}{{#if (eq slot.state 'done')}}Stufe erledigt{{/if}}{{#if (eq slot.state 'locked')}}{{#if ../power.canAfford}}Später / nächste Stufe{{else}}Nicht genug Steine im Pool ({{../power.selectedAttrKey}}){{/if}}{{/if}}">
                  {{#if (eq slot.state 'done')}}
                  <i class="fas fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                  {{else}}
                  <span class="slot-cost">{{#if (eq slot.state 'active')}}{{../power.nextCost}}{{else}}{{slot.displayCost}}{{/if}}</span>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>
                {{/each}}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        {{/each}}
      </div>
    </details>
    {{/if}}
    
    {{#each powersByAttribute as |powers attr|}}
    {{#if powers.length}}
    <details class="power-group" {{#if @first}}open{{/if}}>
      <summary class="power-group-header">
        <h4>
          <i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i>
          {{attr}} Powers
        </h4>
        <span class="power-count">({{powers.length}})</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="powers-grid">
        {{#each powers as |power|}}
        <div class="power-row">
          <div class="power-row-main">
            <div class="power-title">
              <strong class="power-name" title="{{power.description}}">{{power.name}}</strong>
              <button type="button"
                      class="power-activate-btn js-activate-power"
                      data-power-id="{{power.id}}"
                      data-attribute-key="{{power.attribute}}"
                      title="Ohne Ziehen aktivieren ({{power.nextCost}})"
                      {{#unless @root.hasCombat}}disabled{{/unless}}
                      {{#if @root.stonePlanLocked}}disabled title="Gesperrt"{{/if}}
                      {{#unless power.canAfford}}disabled title="Zu wenig Steine"{{/unless}}>
                <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> {{power.nextCost}}
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="power-drop-slots-row">
              <span class="drop-slots-label">Ablage</span>
              <div class="power-drop-slots">
                {{#each power.dropSlots as |slot|}}
                <div class="ms-stone-drop-slot slot-{{slot.state}}{{#unless @root.dragStonesEnabled}} slot-no-drag{{/unless}}"
                     data-power-id="{{../power.id}}"
                     data-pay-attribute="{{../power.attribute}}"
                     data-slot-index="{{slot.index}}"
                     title="{{#if (eq slot.state 'active')}}Aktiv: {{../power.nextCost}}× {{../power.attribute}}-Stein{{/if}}{{#if (eq slot.state 'done')}}Stufe erledigt{{/if}}{{#if (eq slot.state 'locked')}}{{#if ../power.canAfford}}Später{{else}}Nicht genug Steine{{/if}}{{/if}}">
                  {{#if (eq slot.state 'done')}}
                  <i class="fas fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                  {{else}}
                  <span class="slot-cost">{{#if (eq slot.state 'active')}}{{../power.nextCost}}{{else}}{{slot.displayCost}}{{/if}}</span>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>
                {{/each}}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        {{/each}}
      </div>
    </details>
    {{/if}}
    {{/each}}
  </div>

  <div class="dialog-footer stone-powers-footer">
    <div class="stone-prefs-bar">
      <label class="stone-prefs-label">
        <input type="checkbox" class="js-stone-prefs-use-defaults"
               {{#if prefsUseDefaults}}checked{{/if}}
               {{#unless canSavePrefs}}disabled{{/unless}} />
        <span>Standard pro Runde automatisch übernehmen (Attribute unter General Powers)</span>
      </label>
      <button type="button"
              class="dialog-btn dialog-btn-secondary js-save-stone-prefs{{#unless canSavePrefs}} is-disabled{{/unless}}"
              {{#unless canSavePrefs}}disabled title="Nur vor der ersten Aktion in der Runde oder außerhalb des Kampfes"{{/unless}}>
        <i class="fas fa-save"></i> Standard speichern
      </button>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="dialog-btn js-close">
      <i class="fas fa-times"></i> Schließen
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
